# VHS tape for the Unwind demo GIF — https://github.com/charmbracelet/vhs
# Regenerate with:  vhs docs/assets/demo.tape   (requires vhs + ttyd + ffmpeg)
# Produces docs/assets/demo.gif (embedded in README.md).

Output docs/assets/demo.gif

Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 18
Set Width 1200
Set Height 800
Set Padding 20
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"

Type "unwind demo"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 6s
